[[Myung-Hee]] is a merchant found in the [[Royal Court]] of the [[Shing Jea Monastery]]. After completing [[The Jade Vault]] achievement she offers various items for sale.

Bringing all 4 statuettes to her unlocks her as a merchant until the next weekly [[reset]], after which a new set of statuettes has to be brought back again. Handing a statuette grants a Bounty of the statuette's corresponding zone in return. Each statuette can only be handed in once per week.
* {{item icon|Jade Empress Statuette}} gives a [[Bounty of Seitung Province]].
* {{item icon|Jade Gate Statuette}} gives a [[Bounty of New Kaineng City]].
* {{item icon|Jade Cathedral Statuette}} gives a [[Bounty of Echovald Wilds]].
* {{item icon|Jade Dragon Statuette}} gives a [[Bounty of Dragon's End]].

