== Dialogue ==
<small>'''(Before completing The Jade Vault)'''</small>
:Greetings, hero. I'm in a bit of a situation right now. If I could ask your help taking care of this matter, I'd happily return the favor.
:{{dialogue icon|more}} ''What do you need?''
::There is a set of jade statuettes entrusted to my care that have been lent from the vault for display in the provinces.
::{{dialogue icon|more}} ''Go on.''
:::With all this chaos in Cantha, I worry for their safety. Would you look for the statuettes and return them to me? I'll reward you for each one individually. Even more for the full set!
:::{{dialogue icon|more}} ''How much more, exactly?''
::::Let's just say I have access to some unique art pieces and tithes from the provinces that I can make available to you from the vault.
::::{{dialogue icon|more}} ''Where should I look for these statuettes?''
:::::I suspect there's one in each province: Seitung Province, New Kaineng City, Echovald Wilds, and the Jade Sea. You might also find them available at your trading post.
:::::{{dialogue icon|more}} ''Thanks for the info.''
::::::So, would you help me out? <small>'''(Opens collection window.)'''</small>
::::::'''<small>If you have a statuette to turn in.</small>'''
::::::{{dialogue icon|more}} ''I have something for you.''
:::::::Oh, praise the empress! You have one of the statuettes?
:::::::{{dialogue icon|give}} ''Here's the full set.''
::::::::Thank you so much! Here are your bounties for returing the statuettes, and if you'd like, I can show you what's available for trade from the vault.
:::::::::{{dialogue icon|sell}} ''I'd like to see what's available from the vault.''
:::::::::{{dialogue icon|end}} ''Goodbye.''
:::::::{{dialogue icon|give}} ''Here is the [[Jade Empress Statuette|empress statuette]] from Seitung Province.''
:::::::{{dialogue icon|give}} ''Here is the [[Jade Dragon Statuette|dragon statuette]] from Dragon's End.''
:::::::{{dialogue icon|give}} ''Here is the [[Jade Gate Statuette|gate statuette]] from New Kaineng City.''
:::::::{{dialogue icon|give}} ''Here is the [[Jade Cathedral Statuette|cathedral statuette]] from Echovald.''
::::::::Excellent! Here is your bounty. I'll only be able to trade from the vault once all four are secured though.
::::::::<small>'''(If you have more to turn in.)'''</small>
::::::::{{dialogue icon|more}} ''I have another one.''
::::::::'''<small>(Upon turning the final one in.)</small>'''
::::::::That's the last one! Thank you! Here is your bounty, and if you like, I can show you what's available for trade from the vault.
:::::::::{{dialogue icon|sell}} ''I'd like to see what's available from the vault.''
:::::::::{{dialogue icon|end}} ''Goodbye.''
::::::::{{dialogue icon|end}} ''Goodbye.''
:::::::{{dialogue icon|end}} ''Goodbye.''
::::::{{dialogue icon|end}} ''I'll bring you what I can find.''
::::::{{dialogue icon|end}} ''Sorry, I'm a bit busy.''
:{{dialogue icon|more}} ''I have something for you.'' '''<small>(Same as above.)</small>'''
:{{dialogue icon|end}} ''Goodbye.''

<small>'''(After the weekly reset if previously completed The Jade Vault)'''</small>
:I can't believe this! The statuettes are missing again! Could you look for them? I'll reward you handsomely, of course.
:{{dialogue icon|more}} ''Any idea where they might be?'' '''<small>(Same as "Where should I look for these statuettes?" above.)</small>'''
:{{dialogue icon|more}} ''Good news: I have something for you.'' '''<small>(Same as "I have something for you" above.)</small>'''
:{{dialogue icon|end}} ''Goodbye.''

<small>'''(After completing The Jade Vault)'''</small>
:Welcome back, hero! Thanks again for your help recovering our treasures. What can I do for you?
:{{dialogue icon|sell}} ''I'd like to see what's available from the vault.''
:{{dialogue icon|end}} ''I should get going.''

