[[The Jade Vault]] is a [[Cantha]] [[achievement]]. Collect 4 statuettes and return them to [[Myung-Hee]] in the [[Royal Court]] of the [[Shing Jea Monastery]]. Statuettes may be obtained as completion rewards from the following meta-events. Alternatively, they can be purchased from the [[Trading Post]].

* [[Jade Gate Statuette]] - {{event|Kaineng Blackout}}
* [[Jade Cathedral Statuette]] - {{event|The Gang War of Echovald}}
* [[Jade Empress Statuette]] - {{event|Aetherblade Assault}}
* [[Jade Dragon Statuette]] - {{event|The Battle for the Jade Sea}}

Completing this achievement unlocks vendor options from [[Myung-Hee]].

